# Title: Suspicious Reg Add BitLocker
# ID: 0e0255bf-2548-47b8-9582-c0955c9283f5
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2021-11-15
# Tags: attack.impact, attack.t1486
# Description: Detects suspicious addition to BitLocker related registry keys via the reg.exe utility
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((cmdline:*REG* AND cmdline:*ADD* AND cmdline:*\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\FVE* AND cmdline:*/v* AND cmdline:*/f*) AND (cmdline:*EnableBDEWithNoTPM* OR cmdline:*UseAdvancedStartup* OR cmdline:*UseTPM* OR cmdline:*UseTPMKey* OR cmdline:*UseTPMKeyPIN* OR cmdline:*RecoveryKeyMessageSource* OR cmdline:*UseTPMPIN* OR cmdline:*RecoveryKeyMessage*))
